# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# MinuteSim public documentation repository — ignore list
# Anything listed here is workspace-local and MUST NOT reach the public remote.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local documentation governance / AI tooling — NOT published (decision 2026-08-22)
#
# The whole governance layer stays local. Publishing it would disclose the internal
# review pipeline, the disclosure-classification machinery, and the complete list of
# internal terms the leak scanner looks for — none of which improves MinuteSim's
# technical credibility, and the last of which is a roadmap for anyone probing it.
#
# The publish-safe, human-readable summary of this governance lives in
# docs/DOCUMENTATION_GOVERNANCE.md and IS published.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.claude/
CLAUDE.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Never commit binaries, decks, or results copied out of the private repository
# or out of a release package without an explicit disclosure decision.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.zip
*.7z
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.lib
*.obj
*.pdb

# Solver input decks and result artifacts (publish only after review, then force-add)
*.k
*.key
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.xdmf
*.d3plot
*.msh

# Third-party manuals / papers — reference by citation and URL, never redistribute
*.pdf
*.docx

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets and environment
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
secrets/
*.pem
*.pfx
id_rsa
id_dsa
id_ecdsa
id_ed25519

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS / editor noise
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*~
.vscode/
.idea/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Render intermediates (regenerable; see assets/shell/srail/assets_manifest.md)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
_frames_*/
__pycache__/
